{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"there are 5 tennants, and I will explain each in more detail... things you strive for.  One misstep wont wither the bond of body and spirit, but losing sight of the path will....\" he pauses then continues \"Protect life, respect nature, strive for freedom, show mercy, live for the day\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T13:08:12.268000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864855805472145439","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
