{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"nods \"that is what I ask of people\" he then continues \"Respecting nature is next.... all things in nature are a part of all other things.... like streams leading to rivers which in turn lead to oceans.... we are all one.  You can kill an animal... or fell a tree.... but only if its with purpose....\" he takes a moment to eat another berry \"don't burn down a forest because you can make balls of fire.... you are a part of nature, and it is a part of you\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T13:15:27.486000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864857630907564103","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
